# composer.lock is COMMITTED on purpose: these demos are applications, not
# libraries. Composer's own guidance is to commit the lock for a project so
# every run installs the exact same dependency versions; a library omits it to
# let its consumers resolve. Same reason 01/05 commit package-lock.json and 02
# commits go.sum.

